WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.174 --> 00:00:03.174
Imagine I have a

00:00:03.245 --> 00:00:06.354
beautiful tree that's filled with

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:09.174
oranges and I asked myself

00:00:10.265 --> 00:00:18.234
What is the orange made of how do I answer that question? Well, I want to look deeply inside the orange. So I

00:00:18.994 --> 00:00:23.454
Magnify it and I magnify it again and if I keep on doing it deep inside

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:31.974
sooner or later I begin to see molecules come into view but molecules are not the end of the story because the molecules I

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:33.905
can enlarge

00:00:33.905 --> 00:00:38.334
them and if I make them big enough deep inside, I begin to see

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:44.455
Atoms atoms are not the end of the story too because we have electrons

00:00:45.095 --> 00:00:49.554
Zooming around the nucleus deep inside mostly empty space in the atom, but deep inside

00:00:50.075 --> 00:00:53.784
We see the nucleus. So if I grab that and magnify it

00:00:53.784 --> 00:00:59.003
I see that the nucleus is itself made of particles neutrons and protons

00:00:59.885 --> 00:01:04.044
and if I grab one of the neutrons and magnify it

00:01:04.405 --> 00:01:08.964
I find yet further particles little tiny quarks inside

00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:12.714
Now that is where the conventional idea stopped

00:01:13.355 --> 00:01:19.285
String theory comes along and suggests that inside these particles there is something else

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:22.644
So if I take a little quark and I magnify it

00:01:23.644 --> 00:01:27.564
conventional idea says there's nothing inside but string theory says I'll find a little

00:01:28.144 --> 00:01:35.274
tiny filament a little filament of energy a little string like filament and just like the string on a

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.854
Violin, I pluck it and it vibrates

00:01:38.375 --> 00:01:44.334
Creates a little musical note that I can hear the little strings in string theory when they vibrate

00:01:44.765 --> 00:01:48.625
They don't produce musical notes. They produce the particles themselves

00:01:49.195 --> 00:01:55.584
so what quark is nothing but a string vibrating in one pattern an electron is nothing but a

00:01:56.555 --> 00:01:59.394
string vibrating in a different pattern a neutrino

00:02:01.744 --> 00:02:07.794
Nothing but a string vibrating and different patterns still so if I take all of this back together

00:02:07.835 --> 00:02:13.195
I have my ordinary orange and if these ideas are right, they are speculative

00:02:13.195 --> 00:02:17.094
But if they are right deep inside the orange or any other piece of matter

00:02:17.315 --> 00:02:22.044
There's nothing but a dancing vibrating cosmic symphony of strings

00:02:23.195 --> 00:02:25.945
That's the basic idea of string theory

